  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With no prior evidence (experiment 1 of 10), the priority is to establish a strong reference point for the multimodal setting, which is the natural target for 'multimodal cellular profiling.' Config_010 (multimodal, multiprofile, scgpt + resnet50, transformer aggregation, concat fusion) is a well-balanced, canonical multimodal configuration: scgpt provides an expressive learned RNA representation, resnet50 is a reliable pretrained image encoder, transformer aggregation captures inter-cell interactions, and concat fusion is simple and robust. Testing this first tells us (1) whether the multimodal combination is viable and at what performance level, (2) whether the chosen encoders and aggregation are adequate, and (3) gives a concrete baseline to guide ablation (e.g., swap to imagenet_vit_l, try weighted fusion, or test single-modality baselines) in subsequent experiments. It is the highest-information single experiment to anchor the remaining 9 trials."
}

